// @expect-error Override 'write' can throw 'NetError', which the 'write' it overrides in 'Base' does not list. An override throws only what the method it overrides lists. Catch 'NetError' with a 'catch' clause after the body. Or add 'NetError' to the 'throws' list of 'write' in 'Base', and write 'throws NetError' after the signature of this 'write'.
// @expect-error Method 'save' of 'DiskStore' can throw 'NetError', which the 'save' declared by interface 'Store' does not list. An implementing method throws only what the interface lists. Catch 'NetError' with a 'catch' clause after the body. Or add 'NetError' to the 'throws' list of 'save' in 'Store', and write 'throws NetError' after the signature of this 'save'.
// @expect-error Call to 'fetch' can throw 'NetError'. Prefix it with 'try', and catch it with a 'catch' clause after the body.
